        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zebulon%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1895 Pike County Courthouse sits at the heart of Zebulon's historic courthouse square, a hub for retail, dining, and culture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
